Third-party material

The license above covers lensforge's own code and files. It does not cover
the lens prescriptions in examples/ModernLensDesignSmith/. They are taken from
Warren J. Smith, "Modern Lens Design", 2nd ed. (McGraw-Hill, 2005). Many of
these designs come from patents, some may still be patented, and others may
be protected by copyright or other rights. No rights to them are granted
here. Check before using any of them commercially.

See the "Third-party data" section of README.md for the sources of the
bundled glass catalog data.
